{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11830","headline":"戏寄崔评事表侄苏五表弟韦大少府诸侄 · 杜甫","name":"戏寄崔评事表侄苏五表弟韦大少府诸侄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"隐豹深愁雨，潜龙故起云。\n泥多仍径曲，心醉阻贤羣。\n忍待江山丽，还披鲍谢文。\n高楼忆疎豁，秋兴坐氛氲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_11830.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11830","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}